{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0Runeblade Automaton game, you fight monsters in compact arenas. Your task is to place mercenaries before the battle starts, then watch the fight unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action game, your main mission is to pass all the levels succesfully without dying. While the mechanics may seem simple, the key to victory lies in smart planning. The outcome depends entirely on who you place \u2014 and where.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face different types of enemies: some attack in melee, others shoot from a distance, some explode when near your units, and others heal allies or even summon new enemies during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fight is a tactical challenge where your decisions determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarms of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716310?t=1748242571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716310?t=1748242571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716310/51fd3a1e06776ddca95d4c657ce7e83846d573c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748242571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716310/51fd3a1e06776ddca95d4c657ce7e83846d573c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748242571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0Runeblade Automaton game, you fight monsters in compact arenas. Your task is to place mercenaries before the battle starts, then watch the fight unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action game, your main mission is to pass all the levels succesfully without dying. While the mechanics may seem simple, the key to victory lies in smart planning. The outcome depends entirely on who you place \u2014 and where.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face different types of enemies: some attack in melee, others shoot from a distance, some explode when near your units, and others heal allies or even summon new enemies during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fight is a tactical challenge where your decisions determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarms of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels</p></li></ul>","genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716310/da522943a46120e87e0d76cceae34ded575f69d9/header.jpg?t=1748242571","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716310/882440/36b6ff76b3403e8828298018cc6ff8f18eb5b8eb/1750390756/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746642151","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716310/882440/36b6ff76b3403e8828298018cc6ff8f18eb5b8eb/1750390756/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746642151","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716310/882440/36b6ff76b3403e8828298018cc6ff8f18eb5b8eb/1750390756/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746642151","id":257133805,"name":"ert","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse